title: Entra ID Admin Consent Granted to Application
id: f72689d8-a658-4553-8845-5a28580dc4d0
status: experimental
description: Detects an administrator granting tenant-wide consent to an application (Consent to application with admin consent), which authorizes the app's permissions for all users at once, a high-impact abuse of the consent framework.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1528/
logsource:
  product: azure
  service: auditlogs
detection:
  selection:
    OperationName: 'Consent to application'
    Properties|contains: 'ConsentType: AllPrincipals'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - InitiatedBy
  - TargetResources
  - Properties
falsepositives:
  - Approved enterprise application rollouts
level: high
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1528
